WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:26.777
"My bird stamp is lost forever!" cried Bird.

2
00:00:26.778 --> 00:00:39.848
Kip felt terrible.

3
00:00:39.849 --> 00:00:44.472
"I think I'll send a note to Bird," he thought.

4
00:00:44.473 --> 00:01:01.720
Kip went up to his hole.

5
00:01:01.721 --> 00:01:08.704
He found a pencil and some paper.

6
00:01:08.705 --> 00:01:12.080
"Dear Bird," he wrote.

7
00:01:12.081 --> 00:01:17.335
"I'm sorry your bird stamp is lost forever.

8
00:01:17.336 --> 00:01:32.090
Your friend, Kip."

9
00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:36.492
Kip put the note into an envelope.

10
00:01:36.493 --> 00:01:50.241
"Now I just need a stamp," he said.

11
00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:52.577
"This one looks good."

12
00:01:52.578 --> 00:02:07.939
Kip put the stamp on the envelope.

13
00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:20.197
He put the envelope in the mailbox.

14
00:02:20.198 --> 00:02:33.286
The next day Bird got the note.

15
00:02:33.287 --> 00:02:41.799
She cheered when she read it.

16
00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:50.273
"Yay!" cried Bird.

17
00:02:50.274 --> 00:02:58.180
"Thank you, Kip!"

18
00:02:58.181 --> 00:03:01.161
"You got my note?" asked Kip.

19
00:03:01.162 --> 00:03:03.583
"Yes," said Bird.

20
00:03:03.584 --> 00:03:07.891
"And I got my bird stamp back!"

21
00:03:07.892 --> 00:03:10.415
"Where was it?" asked Kip.

22
00:03:10.416 --> 00:03:13.860
Bird laughed.

23
00:03:13.861 --> 00:03:28.953
"You put it on the envelope, silly!"
